      "status": "VERBATIM",
      "evidence": "BRO p.7"
    },
    {
      "where": "copy.system.rtk.body",
      "text": "For environments requiring maximum stability, the C10 supports Emlid RTK base stations and Network RTK (NTRIP). This allows the drone to use GNSS for altitude hold rather than barometers, preventing vertical drift in fluctuating pressure zones.",
